        "nmg.license" to mapOf("en" to "License this expertise", "es" to "Licencia esta pericia", "fr" to "Concéder cette expertise sous licence", "de" to "Diese Fachkunde lizenzieren", "pt" to "Licenciar esta perícia", "it" to "Concedi in licenza questa competenza", "ja" to "この専門性をライセンスする", "zh" to "为这份专长授权", "hi" to "इस विशेषज्ञता का लाइसेंस दें", "ar" to "رخّص هذه الخبرة"),
